  "body": "**Description**\r\n\r\nTransmit the presences from federation to local users, but drop local incoming presence data. This might be a useful setting halfway between fully disabling and fully enabling the presence, especially in larger instances with more local users.\r\n\r\n**Alternatives considered**\r\n\r\n- Faking the presence of local users as online 24/7 (#11721)",
